why: the entry's own ask — "+1.6 (probe) and +3.3 (centroid) with a
  6.6-point spread across four framings, at or near the noise floor
  on 60 messages: re-measure on the grown fixture before making it
  the default, and keep the finding that LONG instructions cost".

what: the same four framings, the same probe/centroid evaluation,
  on the grown fixture (and the parallel set's other languages,
  where an English prefix on a non-English message is its own
  question), against the rozum gateway's embedder — one run, the
  plain baseline beside. A default moves only if the gain clears the
  spread the same run shows; otherwise the entry closes as measured.
